        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b359325-5XVFObl1a3NC.png"
        },
        "description": "The eldest daughter of the Tanuki Aliens, this name is a provisional term adapted to the Earth language. Although she disguises herself in a human-like form, her true appearance closely resembles a tanuki, with tail stripes similar to those of a raccoon. She is a curious and energetic girl. She admires Yachiyo, who scolded her, and begins working at the hotel. \n\nShe excels in science and math subjects, and according to herself, she secretly entered the Imperial Capital Pompoko University’s Department of Space Engineering through a backdoor admission and graduated at the top of her class. Influenced by occult magazines left behind by humans, she has a strong love for the occult.",
